      "text": "📱 Android Phone\n(Sensors & Controls)\n\n🖱️ Trackpad & Gestures\n(Touch coordinates, scrolls, clicks)\n\n⌨️ Virtual Keyboard\n(Unicode chars, Hotkeys, Fn keys)\n\n🎙️ Microphone (AudioRecord)\n(48 kHz Opus / PCM Uplink)\n\n📷 Camera (CameraX)\n(H.264 / NV12 Video Frames)\n\n🔊 Speaker (AudioTrack)\n(Existing WASAPI Downlink)",
