      "text": "🪟 Windows 11 Native APIs\n(Target Subsystems)\n\n🖱️ Keyboard & Mouse:\nWin32 SendInput API (user32.dll)\n• Zero drivers needed, sub-ms cursor movement\n\n🎙️ Microphone Input:\nWDM Virtual Audio Driver / SysVAD\n• Exposes 'Vessel Mic' to Zoom, Discord, Games\n\n📷 Webcam Input:\nWindows Media Foundation (IMFVirtualCamera)\n• Native Win 10/11 virtual camera (No OBS needed)\n\n🔊 Speaker Capture:\nWASAPI Loopback Capture (Current Engine)",
